WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:06.827
Terrell felt the car hit something and stop moving.

2
00:00:06.828 --> 00:00:09.778
"Are you okay?" Roxy's mom asked.

3
00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:11.003
Terrell nodded.

4
00:00:11.004 --> 00:00:14.348
"Good." Roxy's mom unbuckled her seat belt.

5
00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:16.723
"Now do exactly what I say.

6
00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:19.513
We're going to slowly climb out of the—"

7
00:00:19.514 --> 00:00:23.112
Boom! Boom! The ground shook.

8
00:00:23.113 --> 00:00:25.133
Terrell clung to his seat belt.

9
00:00:25.134 --> 00:00:27.336
"Is that another earthquake?"

10
00:00:27.337 --> 00:00:30.883
Crunch! Something smashed the back end of the car.

11
00:00:30.884 --> 00:00:32.903
The car began to rise.

12
00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:37.281
"Something's pulling us out!" Roxy's mom said.

13
00:00:37.282 --> 00:00:42.001
Soon the car was back on flat ground. They climbed out.

14
00:00:42.002 --> 00:00:46.133
"We're safe," Roxy's mom said. "But what . . ."

15
00:00:46.134 --> 00:00:48.747
A giant robot stood over them.

16
00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:52.084
Terrell smiled. "Dr. Odd!"

17
00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:55.430
The robot's head popped open, and Dr. Odd waved.

18
00:00:55.431 --> 00:01:00.157
Bippo sat on his shoulder. "Safe, you!"

19
00:01:00.158 --> 00:01:04.695
*** "I still don't know what's causing the earthquakes," Dr. Odd

20
00:01:04.696 --> 00:01:07.756
said. "But I think I can find Rocket Girl."

21
00:01:07.757 --> 00:01:12.311
Terrell and Roxy's mom were in Dr. Odd's mobile lab, which had a big computer screen.

22
00:01:12.312 --> 00:01:16.651
"We can't reach her by phone," Roxy's mom said.

23
00:01:16.652 --> 00:01:19.573
"I can't either," Dr. Odd said.

24
00:01:19.574 --> 00:01:23.061
"I think there's a firewall blocking our calls.

25
00:01:23.062 --> 00:01:25.651
But this lab has a powerful antenna.

26
00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:29.894
Maybe its signal can break through the firewall.

27
00:01:29.895 --> 00:01:33.847
Then we can talk to her, or at least locate her."

28
00:01:33.848 --> 00:01:36.308
His contacts appeared on the screen.

29
00:01:36.309 --> 00:01:38.839
"You're friends with Von Buzz?"

30
00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:43.723
"He's not so bad." Dr. Odd pressed the icon for Rocket Girl.

31
00:01:43.724 --> 00:01:47.878
A message appeared on the computer's screen: No Connection.

32
00:01:47.879 --> 00:01:51.050
"I'll adjust the antenna's position."

33
00:01:51.051 --> 00:01:56.427
Dr. Odd typed in some code.

34
00:01:56.428 --> 00:01:59.618
The same message appeared: No Connection.

35
00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.160
Terrell groaned.

36
00:02:02.161 --> 00:02:04.845
Roxy's mom drummed her fingers on the desk.

37
00:02:04.846 --> 00:02:06.690
Dr. Odd waved a hand.

38
00:02:06.691 --> 00:02:12.279
"Don't worry. We just need to get the antenna in the right position."

39
00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.990
*** "This stinks!" Roxy

40
00:02:14.991 --> 00:02:17.164
said. Cozlin frowned at the food on her

41
00:02:17.165 --> 00:02:21.343
plate. "I agree. Space beans are

42
00:02:21.344 --> 00:02:25.338
gross." The friends were in a cafeteria where all the fighters were eating and

43
00:02:25.339 --> 00:02:28.460
talking. "I'm not talking about the food," Roxy

44
00:02:28.461 --> 00:02:32.997
said. "I'm mad that I'm stuck here. Metro City is in

45
00:02:32.998 --> 00:02:37.005
danger!" "I need to get back to the Tang Monk," Wukong

46
00:02:37.006 --> 00:02:40.876
said. Cozlin sighed. "I have to get back to

47
00:02:40.877 --> 00:02:46.470
Delkor. Sapphire caused so much damage. I need to help fix

48
00:02:46.471 --> 00:02:50.136
everything." Roxy snorted. "Yeah. It was your

49
00:02:50.137 --> 00:02:54.138
fault." "I know it's my fault!" Cozlin waved her

50
00:02:54.139 --> 00:02:56.679
hand. Space beans flew off her

51
00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.627
fork. A voice growled. "Who threw

52
00:02:59.628 --> 00:03:01.781
that?" Roxy looked

53
00:03:01.782 --> 00:03:04.271
over. A large creature with tentacles stood up.

54
00:03:04.272 --> 00:03:06.679
Space beans dripped from its head.

55
00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:10.562
"Sorry," Cozlin said. "That was—"

56
00:03:10.563 --> 00:03:14.289
Wham! A bowl of slop hit her in the face.

57
00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:18.227
"Grr!" Cozlin flung the rest of her meal at the creature.

58
00:03:18.228 --> 00:03:22.419
The creature ducked, and the food hit an alien sitting nearby.

59
00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:27.564
Wukong laughed. The alien wiped the food from its face.

60
00:03:27.565 --> 00:03:31.366
"You think that's funny?"

61
00:03:31.367 --> 00:03:36.483
Soon food was flying in every direction.

62
00:03:36.484 --> 00:03:39.737
"Everyone, stop!" Roxy shouted.

63
00:03:39.738 --> 00:03:41.678
The room grew quiet.

64
00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:43.690
"We shouldn't fight each other.

65
00:03:43.691 --> 00:03:46.715
We should work together to escape!"

66
00:03:46.716 --> 00:03:53.006
Glytar laughed. "No way! I want that golden asteroid!"

67
00:03:53.007 --> 00:03:56.689
"Well, too bad for you!" a bug said.

68
00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:59.937
"Because I'm going to win this competition!"

69
00:03:59.938 --> 00:04:02.530
"No, you're not!" someone shouted.

70
00:04:02.531 --> 00:04:06.976
As all the fighters argued, Roxy heard a familiar beeping sound.

71
00:04:06.977 --> 00:04:08.324
It was her watch.

72
00:04:08.332 --> 00:04:14.395
Roxy opened it and smiled. "Terrell!"

